       notifications-bell) read this once and localize their modals, labels
       and alerts (with the en floor as the in-code fallback). HtmlEncoded so
       a value containing `</script>` can never terminate the element. *@
    <script type="application/json" id="kumunita-strings">@System.Web.HttpUtility.HtmlEncode(clientStringsJson)</script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
